          {
            "id": "t14_r4_para_6",
            "paragraphIndex": 6,
            "text": "Nowadays, there are many delicious options for those who choose not to eat meat. From vibrant salads loaded with fresh vegetables to hearty grain bowls filled with quinoa and beans, the possibilities are endless. Creative recipes often incorporate a variety of fruits, nuts, and plant-based proteins, providing a satisfying array of flavors and textures. International cuisines, such as Indian curries or Mediterranean mezze, showcase the versatility of meat-free dining and highlight the diverse ways people can enjoy plant-based meals."
